OL,3,GNEWSAShould Aberdeen schools have
OL,4,A'winter cards' instead of Christmas
OL,5,Acards?
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew guidelines could be introduced for
OL,8,FAberdeen schools after a primary's use
OL,9,Fof the term winter cards instead of
OL,10,FChristmas sparked controversy.
OL,12,FKaimhill School recently faced a
OL,13,Fbacklash over its suggested terminology
OL,14,Ffor cards over the festive period to
OL,15,Freflect inclusivity.
OL,17,FNow a motion is to go before
OL,18,Fcouncillors calling for clarity in
OL,19,Ffuture - and to not "exclude"
OL,20,FChristianity.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
