OL,3,GNEWSAShould Aberdeen schools have
OL,4,A'winter cards' instead of Christmas
OL,5,Acards?
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt calls for guidelines to be issued to
OL,8,Fschools "to ensure that any
OL,9,Fmisunderstandings with regard to
OL,10,Ffestival-related activities do not
OL,11,Fhappen again".
